(いわゆる超臨界二酸化炭素抽出法)の採用により、本来の深く豊かな味と香りをそのまま残しています。新たにフェアトレード認証を取得し、デザインリニューアル。 MOUNT HAGEN(マウントハーゲン)のオーガニックコーヒーは、焙煎コーヒーもインスタントコーヒーも伝統的有機農法で栽培され、手摘みされた極上の高地栽培コーヒー豆のみを使用しています。 ゆっくりと丁寧な...","image_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/41nFTAVlg-L._SR600%2c315_PIWhiteStrip%2cBottomLeft%2c0%2c35_PIStarRatingFOURANDHALF%2cBottomLeft%2c360%2c-6_SR600%2c315_ZA2%252C769%2c445%2c290%2c400%2c400%2cAmazonEmberBold%2c12%2c4%2c0%2c0%2c5_SCLZZZZZZZ_FMpng_BG255%2c255%2c255.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"amazon.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B01C5JMW90/","original_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B01C5JMW90/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zQ=4H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2954af47-294a-45fd-be4d-a3a74b8dca28","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://www.fashion-press.net/news/80564\u003e :551:","ts":"1636706592.091800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r3qF3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc38a705-998c-436e-9304-58aeb5f15963","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"japanese old style cafeしてきました","ts":"1636692137.091300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ASc=x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"793328d8-de3c-42e5-a81d-fb7b9c103be9","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://www.instagram.com/p/CWKaetmvl7_/?utm_medium=copy_link|https://www.instagram.com/p/CWKaetmvl7_/?utm_medium=copy_link\u003e","ts":"1636692115.090600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Instagram Photo:","id":1,"author_name":"peacock0803sz","image_url":"https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/e35/s480x480/255256930_436944764498646_6246443078958439434_n.jpg?_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com\u0026_nc_cat=106\u0026_nc_ohc=rmBZDj_HzUMAX_H8GT6\u0026edm=AMO9-JQAAAAA\u0026ccb=7-4\u0026oh=8d3b021c0f